# Loop-current order through the kagome looking glass

Rafael M. Fernandes

Department of Physics, University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign, Urbana, Illinois 61801, USA Anthony J. Leggett Institute for Condensed Matter Theory, University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign, Urbana, Illinois 61801, USA

